    "region containing the lens galaxy and its arc. Pixels far outside that region\n",
    "are just background sky or unrelated galaxies, and including them would only\n",
    "add noise/computation without helping the fit (and could even bias it, if an\n",
    "unrelated bright object sat in the frame).\n",
    "\n",
    "We use a circular mask of radius 3.5 arcsec, matching what the COWLS team\n",
    "themselves used when they originally studied this lens -- letting us roughly\n",
    "reproduce their setup.\n"
